{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04760","headline":"洛桥北亭诏饯诸刺史 · 张说","name":"洛桥北亭诏饯诸刺史","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"离亭拂御沟，别曲舞船楼。\n诏饯朝廷牧，符分海县忧。\n股肱还入郡，父母更临州。\n扇逐仁风传，车随霖雨流。\n恩光水上溢，荣色柳间浮。\n预待羣方最，三公不远求。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04760.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04760","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}